===Etymology===
{{etymon|ang|id=to sit|inh|gmw-pro>*sittjan>to sit|tree=1}}
{{root|ang|ine-pro|*sed-}} {{dercat|ang|gem-pro|ine-pro|inh=1}}
From {{inh|ang|gmw-pro|*sittjan}}.

{{rel-top|Cognates}}
Cognate with {{cog|ofs|sitta}} ({{cog|fy|sitte}}), {{cog|goh|sizzen}} ({{cog|de|sitzen}}), {{cog|osx|sittian}}, {{cog|nl|zitten}}, {{cog|non|sitja}} ({{cog|is|sitja}}, {{cog|fo|sita}}, {{cog|sv|sitta}}), {{cog|got|𐍃𐌹𐍄𐌰𐌽}}. The {{cog|ine-pro|-}} root is also the source of {{cog|sa|सीदति}}, {{cog|xcl|նիստ||sitting}}, {{cog|sga|saidid}} ({{cog|ga|suigh}}), {{cog|grc|ἕζομαι}}, {{cog|la|sedeō}}, {{cog|cu|sc=Cyrs|сѣдѣти}} ({{cog|ru|сиде́ть}}). {{rel-bottom}}

